00:26:12.630 --> 00:26:15.090
They buy a crypto that
is already programmed,

00:26:15.090 --> 00:26:16.947
already compatible
with IoT Core.

00:26:16.947 --> 00:26:18.280
There is nothing to do for them.

00:26:18.280 --> 00:26:19.280
NICOLAS SHIELI: Correct.

00:26:19.280 --> 00:26:21.500
So a second intermediate
certificate authority

00:26:21.500 --> 00:26:23.550
private key is stored
in our hardware security

00:26:23.550 --> 00:26:27.660
modules that are on our
