00:40:54.690 --> 00:40:56.950
good enough at runtime.

00:40:56.950 --> 00:40:58.340
So we have implement this.

00:40:58.340 --> 00:40:59.760
ANTONY PASSEMARD: Yeah.

00:40:59.760 --> 00:41:01.830
One other question is,
is the integration effort

00:41:01.830 --> 00:41:05.832
