for all the use cases,

00:41:41.610 --> 00:41:43.910
because they are all dependent.

00:41:43.910 --> 00:41:46.650
Assuming that you have a way
of getting your new firmware

00:41:46.650 --> 00:41:49.050
into the device,
then the 608A can be

00:41:49.050 --> 00:41:50.732
